==Description==
The '''Sunlight Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 31 of the premium [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,070}} or {{Robux|92}} ({{Robux|78}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|15,580}} or {{Robux|2,522}} ({{Robux|2,129}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''Sunlight Nametag''' has a pale gradient orange text with a bright golden glow. Behind the text is a radiant circle with a 22° halo resembling a sunburst. A similar aura can also be seen emitting from the player's torso, small glowing sparkles also appear around the character as well.

